l},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-12-28T18:03:42Z","updated_at":"2026-01-05T11:08:52Z","closed_at":"2026-01-05T11:08:50Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.6.dev [63227bbc8a]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.beta (f68f60bd4) - macOS Tahoe (26.2.0) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - Apple M2 Pro - Apple M2 Pro (10 threads) - 16.00 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe macOS camera module has several issues:\n\n1. Unnecessary transform applied - In CameraMacOS::update_feeds(), a hardcoded Transform2D(-1.0, 0.0, 0.0, -1.0, 1.0, 1.0) is applied to all camera feeds, causing unwanted rotation/mirroring on MacBooks. Unlike mobile devices, desktop cameras don't require orientation correction.\n2. activate_feed() always returns true - Even when camera initialization fails or permission is denied, the function returns true, making it impossible for the caller to know if the camera actually activated.\n3. No early return on initialization failure - In MyCaptureSession initForFeed:andDevice:, when input or output device acquisition fails, the code continues execution instead of returning nil.\n4. Missing null check - captureOutput:didOutputSampleBuffer:fromConnection: doesn't check if pixelBuffer is nullptr before using it.\n5. Permission denial not reported - When AVAuthorizationStatusDenied or AVAuthorizationStatusRestricted, there's no feedback to the user.\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nFor unnecessary transform issue:\n1. Clone and open the MRP project on a MacBook\n2. Run the project and select a camera\n3. Observe the camera preview is rotated/mirrored incorrectly\n\nFor error handling issue:\n1. Open System Preferences > Privacy & Security > Camera\n2. Deny camera permission for Godot\n3. Run the MRP project\n4. feed_is_active becomes true but no camera preview appears\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nhttps://github.com/shiena/godot-camerafeed-demo","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"M